    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nMcDonald Property, Lucan's longest-established Auctioneers, Valuers and Estate Agents, are delighted to present 5 ST HELENS DOWNS, Adamstown, to the market.\n\nSituated within the highly sought-after St. Helens development, this spacious mid-terrace residence is an impressive A3-rated three-bedroom family home, offering bright, well-proportioned accommodation and presented in excellent condition throughout.\n\nExtending to approximately 94 sq. m., the accommodation comprises a generous front-facing living room, a large kitchen/dining area with separate utility room, a spacious ground floor bathroom, and three sizeable bedrooms. Outside, the property benefits from off-street parking to the front and a large, private rear garden, ideal for family life and outdoor entertaining.\n\nConveniently located close to a wide range of local amenities, including schools, shops, parks, and excellent public transport services, this superb home also enjoys easy access to the N4, M50 and Dublin City Centre. Combining style, space and convenience, No. 5 represents an ideal opportunity for families seeking a quality home in one of Lucan's most modern and convenient residential locations.\n\n \n\nKEY FEATURES:\n\nSpacious internal accommodation extending to over c. 1,010 square feet\n\nLarge and private rear garden\n\n2 x large bathrooms to include tiled floors, tiled walls\n\nLarge well equipped Utility Room with additional fitted units and cabinets\n\nSeparate Living Room on ground floor\n\nModern and stylish kitchen with large dining area\n\nAttic is partially floored, and has potential to convert for additional living space\n\nAmple storage throughout house with separate storage unit and separate hot press with bespoke shelving\n\nRear garden is private with lights and external tap\n\nWalking distance to local schools, shops, train station and bus stops servicing the city centre\n\nSeveral amenity greens and parks nearby (including football pitch, cricket pitch, tennis courts, Tram Cafe)\n\n2 minutes walk to Tandys Park\n\n5 minutes walk to Airlie Park\n\n10 minutes walk to Tesco, Aldi\n\nShort walk to Adamstown Train Station servicing Grand Canal Dock\n\nGas heating throughout (Glowworm boiler)\n\nA3 BER Rating\n\nDriveway to front for designated parking with additional visitor parking to side\n\nHigh-performance double-glazed windows throughout\n\nAdvanced insulation system \n\nAutomatic ventilation system\n\nSolar panels\n\nZoned heating throughout\n\nAlarmed\n\nExternal tap\n\nWater softener system with filtration system\n\n \n\nACCOMMODATION:\n\nDOWNSTAIRS:\n\nEntrance Hallway with alarm point, composite front door, tiled floor, understairs storage\n\nLiving Room: to front of house, with porcelain tiled flooring, curtains and blinds, radiator cover\n\nKitchen / Dining Room: with porcelain tiled floor, extensive range of cream-coloured kitchen units at floor- and eye- level, tiled splashback, Indesit dishwasher, 4 x ring gas hob, Indesit oven, Faber extractor fan, Indesit integrated fridge / freezer, Glowworm boiler, spotlights and feature pendant hanging lights over dining area, blinds, access to rear garden \n\nUtility Room: with ample range of cream-coloured fitted kitchen units at floor and eye level, Indesit washing machine, Climote control panel\n\nGround floor bathroom: spacious, with tiled floor, partially tiled walls, wc, whb, ventilation point, mounted mirror unit\n\nUPSTAIRS:\n\nMaster Bedroom: to front of house with fitted wardrobes, laminate flooring.\n\nBedroom 2: to rear of house with walled-to wall fitted wardrobes, laminate flooring, blinds\n\nBedroom 3: to front of house with laminate flooring, blinds, wardrobes\n\nFamily Bathroom: with partially tiled walls, fully tiled floor, wc, whb, window to side\n\nOUTSIDE:\n\nLarge and private rear garden, fenced in\n\nRear garden is not over-looked\n\nGarden has apple tree\n\nExternal tap\n\nThe front has ample off road parking\n\nMinimum passing traffic.\n\nDesignated car park space\n\n[Measurements provided are approximate and intended for guidance. Descriptions, photographs and floor plans are provided for illustrative and guidance purposes. Errors, omissions, inaccuracies, or mis-descriptions in these materials do not entitle any party to claims, actions, or compensation against McDonald Property or the vendor. Prospective buyers or interested parties are responsible for conducting their own due diligence, inspections, or other inquiries to verify the accuracy of the information provided. McDonald Property have not tested any appliances, apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Prospective buyers or interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items.\n\n"
      },
